<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεῖπον</span></b> , inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξειπεῖν,</span>
		aor. 2 in use of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγορεύω;
		ἐξερῶ</span> (q.v.) being the fut.: also aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεῖπας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					521
				</span></i>
			:—<i>tell out, declare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείπω καὶ πάντα διίξομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτίκ᾽ ἂν ἐξείποι Ἀγαμέμνονι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.654
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.443
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὅτι μοι παρορᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκριβείᾳ χαλεπὸν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.87
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dupl. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὰ ἐ. τινά</span>
			<i>tell</i> evil <i>tales of</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.79
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίν᾽ ἀρχήν σ᾽ ἐξείπω κακῶν;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					907
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ πρὸς πολλούς με δὴ ἐξεῖπας, ὡς
					. .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					521
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				984
			</span></i>.</div>
